Scope
-----
The licence above covers every file authored by the Lindos Team in this
repository: the build pipeline (build/), the packages (packages/*/), the
tests (tests/), the documentation (docs/, README.md, CONTRIBUTING.md,
SPEC.md) and the original SVG artwork (wallpapers, logo, icons) shipped in
packages/lindos-desktop, packages/lindos-compat and packages/lindos-gaming.

The verbatim text of the GNU General Public License version 3 is published
by the Free Software Foundation at <https://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl-3.0.txt>
and is installed on every Debian/Ubuntu/Mint system (and therefore on every
Lindos system) at /usr/share/common-licenses/GPL-3.

Third-party components
----------------------
Lindos is a remaster of Linux Mint XFCE (Ubuntu LTS base). Everything the
build downloads or installs from other projects — the Fluent GTK/icon/cursor
themes, the Selawik and Inter fonts, Wine/Proton/umu-launcher, Steam and the
other launchers, drivers, Flatpaks — keeps its own licence. THIRD_PARTY.md
lists each of them with its licence and source. Microsoft Edge and Google
Chrome are never redistributed inside the ISO; they are downloaded from the
vendors' own apt repositories at first login, subject to their licences.

